{"title":"Career Roadmap · Full Stack Developer","role":"Full Stack Developer","summary":"A Full Stack Developer builds and maintains applications across the frontend, backend, databases, APIs, deployment infrastructure, and application security.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"CSE – Full Stack / DevOps / SRE (Industry-integrated)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Full Stack Developer builds and maintains applications across the frontend, backend, databases, APIs, deployment infrastructure, and application security."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSE graduate specializing in Full Stack / DevOps / SRE, the ideal profile goes beyond learning a frontend framework. The student should understand the complete software lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirements","UI","API","Backend","Database","Testing","CI/CD","Cloud","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile combines software engineering + cloud + DevOps + reliability practices, allowing progression toward Senior Software Engineer, Backend Engineer, Cloud Engineer, DevOps Engineer, SRE, or Software Architect."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Software Foundation"},{"text":"Developer Intern → Junior Full Stack Developer"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Full-Stack Engineering"},{"text":"Full Stack Developer → Software Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Technical Specialization"},{"text":"Senior Software Engineer / Backend / Cloud / SRE"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Technical Leadership"},{"text":"Tech Lead / Staff Engineer / Architect / Engineering Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Programm