ate frontend, backend and database skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Authentication System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Registration","Password Hashing","Login","Authentication","Authorization","Role-Based Access"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Password hashing"},{"text":"JWT"},{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"OAuth basics"},{"text":"RBAC"},{"text":"MFA concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never store passwords as plain text."},{"type":"h","text":"API Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST principles"},{"text":"Resource design"},{"text":"Pagination"},{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"API versioning"},{"text":"Rate limiting"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"Error responses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OpenAPI/Swagger"},{"text":"Postman"},{"text":"API testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn multiple levels:"},{"type":"h","text":"Unit testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test individual functions/components."},{"type":"h","text":"Integration testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test interactions between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"API"},{"text":"Database"},{"text":"Services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"End-to-end testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test complete user journeys."},{"type":"p","text":"Tools can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JUnit"},{"text":"Jest"},{"text":"Vitest"},{"text":"Playwright"},{"text":"Cypress"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose tools appropriate to the technology stack."},{"type":"h","text":"Git & Collaboration"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub/GitLab"},{"text":"Branching"},{"text":"Pull requests"},{"text":"Merge conflicts"},{"text":"Code review"},{"text":"Commit hygiene"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Feature Branch","Code","Tests","Pull Request","Code Review","Merge","CI/CD"]},{"type":"