ext":"Tools/platforms can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prometheus"},{"text":"Grafana"},{"text":"OpenTelemetry"},{"text":"Cloud-native monitoring services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"p","text":"A full-stack developer should understand application security."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OWASP Top 10"},{"text":"SQL injection"},{"text":"XSS"},{"text":"CSRF"},{"text":"Authentication vulnerabilities"},{"text":"Authorization failures"},{"text":"Secure headers"},{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"Dependency vulnerabilities"},{"text":"HTTPS/TLS"},{"text":"Input validation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Security should be considered throughout development rather than added only after deployment."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Production-Ready Full Stack Application"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete application with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"React/Next.js"},{"text":"Backend API"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"RBAC"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"Tests"},{"text":"Docker"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-user project-management platform"},{"type":"flow","items":["React","REST API","Spring Boot / Node.js","PostgreSQL"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — E-Commerce Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User registration"},{"text":"Product catalog"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Payments integration"},{"text":"Admin panel"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Authentication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Cloud deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — DevOps Deployment Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy a full-stack application using:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GitHub","CI/CD","Docker","Cloud","Kubernetes","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated tests"},{"text":"Containerization"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"Health checks"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"Metrics"},{"text":"Rollback"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — SRE Monitoring Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy an application and build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Application metrics"},{"text":"Infrastructure metrics"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Alerts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Request rate"},{"text":"Error rate"},{"text":"Latency"},{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Availability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Scalable Full-Stack System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an application capable of handling increased traffic."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Caching"},{"text":"Database indexing"},{"text":"Horizontal scaling"},{"text":"Queue-based processing"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the architecture and explain the trade-offs."},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Full Stack Developer Intern"},{"text":"Software Developer Intern"},{"text":"Backend Developer Intern"},{"text":"Frontend Developer Intern"},{"text":"Web Developer Intern"},{"text":"DevOps Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Engineering Intern"},{"text":"SRE Intern"},{"text":"Software Engineering Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong internship environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Product companies"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Cloud companies"},{"text":"Technology startups"},{"text":"IT services companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize internships where the student writes production code, works with Git, APIs, databases, testing and deployment rather than only building static w